subject: [[your old clients | who's calling your past clients? | clients you already won]]

Hi {first_name|there},

(({company.opener}))

I found you on the {company_name} site((, listed as {title})), so I figured you're the one to ask.

I'm a software engineer out of Waterloo. I've built production systems with big teams at the Government of Canada (one is used by 17,000 staff) and with a small research lab at the University of Alberta.

I'd bet your ATS holds years of past clients nobody has called in a while. Some of those hiring managers moved to new companies with new budgets, and a few are hiring right now.

I'll book you {offer.goal} meetings with them. If I don't book one in {offer.days} days, you get every dollar back.

I know you're busy, so all it takes is an export from your ATS and one 30-minute call at the start. I'll handle the rest, writing in your recruiter's name from a new domain so yours is never touched. I only take {offer.slots} firms at a time.

I recorded a short walkthrough of how it works. Want me to send it? Or for a call, how does {call.times} sound? I can send you a calendar invite. Just let me know.

William
